      "content": "that's a good start but the activist sounds a bit too \"unhinged\" even for what i asked. can u rewrite it so the senator's points are actually really strong and hard to argue with? like, give him some really heavy-hitting, intellectual justifications for why the surveillance is good for society. and then for the activist, maybe make them more like... just a bit overwhelmed and unable to keep up with the senator's logic, instead of just yelling about their grandma.",
